                                <color key="backgroundColor" systemColor="secondaryLabelColor"/>
                                <string key="text">Our project will be a Cookbook App. The App will provide menus for Brekafast, Lunch, and additionally provide a search function to look for recipes by keyword, no matter which menu they are in. Each recipe will include details like ingredients, prep time, and other prep requirements, as well as a description of the food itself and nutrition labeling. There will also be functionality to add a new recipe with your own specifications</string>
